1
00:00:00,345 --> 00:00:01,805
(Leonard:)However briefly.

2
00:00:03,056 --> 00:00:05,306
(Sheldon:)Do you think this possibility
will be hindered...

3
00:00:05,475 --> 00:00:09,355
(Sheldon:)...when she discovers your Luke Skywalker
"no more tears" shampoo?

4
00:00:10,063 --> 00:00:12,563
(Leonard:)It's Darth Vader shampoo.

5
00:00:12,732 --> 00:00:13,772
[KNOCKING ON DOOR]

6
00:00:13,942 --> 00:00:16,322
(Leonard:)Luke Skywalker's the conditioner.

7
00:00:18,238 --> 00:00:20,738
- Wait till you see this.
- It's fantastic. Unbelievable.

8
00:00:20,907 --> 00:00:22,037
(Leonard:)See what?

9
00:00:23,243 --> 00:00:27,453
(Howard:)It's a Stephen Hawking lecture from MIT
in 1974.

10
00:00:27,622 --> 00:00:28,832
This isn't a good time.

11
00:00:28,998 --> 00:00:31,128
[IMITATING COMPUTERIZED VOICE]
It's before he became...

12
00:00:31,292 --> 00:00:33,122
...a creepy computer voice.

13
00:00:35,129 --> 00:00:37,009
- That's great, you guys have to go.
- Why?

14
00:00:37,173 --> 00:00:40,173
- It's just not a good time.
- Leonard has a lady over.

15
00:00:40,718 --> 00:00:43,598
[IN NORMAL VOICE] Yeah, right.
Your grandmother back in town?

16
00:00:45,431 --> 00:00:46,431
(Sheldon:)No.

17
00:00:46,599 --> 00:00:49,099
(Leonard:)And she's not a lady,
she's just a new neighbor.

18
00:00:49,269 --> 00:00:52,019
(Howard:)Hang on, there really is a lady here?

19
00:00:52,188 --> 00:00:53,648
- Uh-huh.
- And you want us out...

20
00:00:53,815 --> 00:00:55,855
(Howard:)...because you're anticipating coitus?

21
00:00:56,442 --> 00:00:59,232
- I'm not anticipating coitus.
- So she's available for coitus?

